1071
01:03:03,380 --> 01:03:05,820
but Nate gets angry at her because she's Lexi's sister.

1072
01:03:06,079 --> 01:03:08,880
He tells her to get lost and move her things out of his house.

1073
01:03:09,199 --> 01:03:13,179
He adds that there's nothing to laugh about because the whole dance number is homophobic.

1074
01:03:14,039 --> 01:03:18,099
Cassie returns to the entrance of the theater, peeking inside with tears flowing down her cheeks.

1075
01:03:18,539 --> 01:03:21,840
Episode 8 continues with Fez's situation from the last episode.

1076
01:03:22,199 --> 01:03:23,940
Just before leaving to watch Lexi's play,

1077
01:03:24,079 --> 01:03:29,480
Ashtray and Fez find out that Custer is there to record a conversation about Mouse's death to rat them out.

1078
01:03:29,960 --> 01:03:35,480
Ashtray goes on the offensive and stabs Custer with a box cutter on the neck, which forces Fez to help.

1079
01:03:35,760 --> 01:03:38,960
Then he grabs the phone and dips it in a nearby cup to stop the recording.

1080
01:03:39,360 --> 01:03:40,059
Back to Lexi.

1081
01:03:40,400 --> 01:03:44,219
She's starting to worry about Fez's empty seat while Cassie enters the theater once more.

1082
01:03:44,579 --> 01:03:47,280
Susie notices her face and worries about what will happen next.

1083
01:03:47,579 --> 01:03:49,500
Cassie heads straight to the stage and wreaks havoc.

1084
01:03:49,880 --> 01:03:52,519
She calls out Lexi for airing her dirty laundry.

1085
01:03:52,920 --> 01:03:56,460
She goes on to tell Lexi that she's just an observer because she's not lived life.

1086
01:03:56,980 --> 01:04:01,739
Ouch. Suze comes up onto the stage to try and defuse the situation, but it doesn't work.

1087
01:04:01,940 --> 01:04:05,699
Before leaving, Cassie asks Lexi if they're at the part where she steals Nate.

1088
01:04:06,059 --> 01:04:08,940
Lexi tells her that it's not in the play, but Maddie, as...

1089
01:04:08,980 --> 01:04:10,099
Maddie has had enough of Cassie's...

1090
01:04:10,860 --> 01:04:13,579
Is this the part of the play where I steal Jake from Marta?

1091
01:04:13,679 --> 01:04:15,300
No, Cassie, that's not in the play.

1092
01:04:15,659 --> 01:04:16,380
It is now.

1093
01:04:17,119 --> 01:04:19,800
Hearing that, Cassie tries to explain that Maddie and Nate weren't together,

1094
01:04:20,219 --> 01:04:21,320
but Maddie keeps interrupting.

1095
01:04:21,800 --> 01:04:23,719
Suze momentarily pauses the argument,

1096
01:04:23,880 --> 01:04:29,380
but Cassie hits her breaking point when the play starts satirizing her infamous carousel scene at the carnival.

1097
01:04:29,699 --> 01:04:31,780
Cassie storms the stage to attack the actress,

1098
01:04:32,079 --> 01:04:33,639
and Maddie charges after Cassie.

1099
01:04:33,900 --> 01:04:36,760
The fight continues, ultimately forcing Cassie, Maddie, Bebe,

1100
01:04:37,099 --> 01:04:37,960
and Cat out of the theater.

1101
01:04:38,659 --> 01:04:39,920
Then a flashback starts playing.

1102
01:04:40,300 --> 01:04:43,079
It's when Rue visited Elliot's house after the intervention.

1103
01:04:43,599 --> 01:04:47,400
She told him that she's forgiven him because his ratting her out might have actually saved her life.

1104
01:04:47,699 --> 01:04:49,760
She also apologizes for her actions that day.

1105
01:04:50,059 --> 01:04:53,599
Elliot accepts it and plays Elliot's song, an original composition.

1106
01:04:54,019 --> 01:04:57,460
Finally, Elliot asks if they could still be friends, but Rue denies it,

1107
01:04:57,559 --> 01:05:00,780
saying that it was he who said they weren't good for each other.

1108
01:05:01,219 --> 01:05:04,880
Back to the play, Bobby finds Lexi in the backstage area, distraught.

1109
01:05:05,280 --> 01:05:08,079
Bobby tells her that she told the audience it's part of the play.

1110
01:05:08,699 --> 01:05:12,079
But Lexi loses confidence and says that the play is a disaster.

1111
01:05:12,460 --> 01:05:16,079
Bobby encourages her by saying that it could be boring, which is worse.

1112
01:05:16,539 --> 01:05:18,000
Then she says that art should be dangerous.

1113
01:05:18,539 --> 01:05:21,280
Following this, Lexi regains her confidence and starts preparing.

1114
01:05:21,659 --> 01:05:27,860
Rue, at the audience seats, starts a Lexi chant to encourage Lexi and the actors to continue the play.

1115
01:05:28,219 --> 01:05:31,340
Lexi comes out to the stage and admits that she did not see any of that coming.

1116
01:05:31,739 --> 01:05:37,300
She then talks about a conversation she had with a friend about a time when she was worried that her play might hurt people.

1117
01:05:37,719 --> 01:05:39,420
That friend, of course, is Fez.

1118
01:05:39,780 --> 01:05:41,980
And he's not having a grand old time at all.

1119
01:05:42,300 --> 01:05:47,440
After Custer's death, Fez tells Ashtray to simply surrender and that he'll take the fall for Ashtray.

1120
01:05:47,659 --> 01:05:53,119
However, Ashtray doesn't want to do this and locks himself in the bathroom after gathering the guns inside the house.

1121
01:05:53,579 --> 01:05:56,300
Moments later, the police break into the house and subdue Fez.

1122
01:05:56,619 --> 01:06:00,800
The police then ask Fez to slowly back off the bathroom door.

1123
01:06:01,139 --> 01:06:05,579
Ashtray starts unloading bullets and an extended shootout happens between him and the police.

1124
01:06:06,119 --> 01:06:07,340
Then Ashtray feigns death.

1125
01:06:07,519 --> 01:06:11,059
Which leads to one officer opening the door and falling at Ashtray's trap.

1126
01:06:11,400 --> 01:06:14,059
Ashtray then picks up a nearby shotgun and kills the officer.

1127
01:06:14,400 --> 01:06:17,440
The scene then fades as another officer shoots Ashtray, killing him.

1128
01:06:17,860 --> 01:06:20,500
Damn. Meanwhile, Nate finds Cal at a warehouse.

1129
01:06:20,980 --> 01:06:25,320
The two share a short conversation before Nate reveals that he has reported Cal to the police.

1130
01:06:25,739 --> 01:06:30,199
The show wasn't clear on what charges, but it most likely has something to do with the tapes he has.

1131
01:06:30,559 --> 01:06:33,719
Shortly after, police officers arrive at the scene to arrest Cal.

1132
01:06:34,239 --> 01:06:36,280
Nate leaves the warehouse with tears in his eyes.

1133
01:06:36,659 --> 01:06:40,860
Back to Lexi's play, the current scene is heavily based on Rue's reading of her eulogy.

1134
01:06:40,960 --> 01:06:45,179
Again. The audience reacts emotionally to the scene unfolding in front of them.

1135
01:06:45,519 --> 01:06:50,920
Rue specifically starts crying as she relives the painful memories associated with that specific part of her life.

1136
01:06:51,300 --> 01:06:55,559
The day after the play, Rue calls Lexi to tell her that she really enjoyed the play.

1137
01:06:55,900 --> 01:06:58,119
Rue asks if she can come over and Lexi says yes.

1138
01:06:58,500 --> 01:06:59,840
After arriving at Lexi's place,

1139
01:07:00,099 --> 01:07:05,199
Rue tells her that watching her play felt like the only time she could take a look at her life and not hate herself.

1140
01:07:05,559 --> 01:07:08,300
Rue adds that the play really meant the world to her.

1141
01:07:08,619 --> 01:07:12,380
After a lengthy pause, Lexi asks Rue if she thinks about her dad often,

1142
01:07:12,659 --> 01:07:15,539
and the two of them start sharing their traumas regarding their dads,

1143
01:07:15,920 --> 01:07:17,960
while also reaffirming their love for each other.

1144
01:07:18,280 --> 01:07:19,719
We then switch back to the end of the play,

1145
01:07:19,920 --> 01:07:23,400
where the curtains close and the audience erupts in a loud applause.

1146
01:07:23,699 --> 01:07:27,420
Then, the scene shifts over to Cassie, Maddie, Kat, and Bebe in the bathroom.

1147
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:30,260
Both Cassie and Maddie are wounded because of their fight.

1148
01:07:30,579 --> 01:07:33,900
Cassie reveals that Nate broke up with her before she went to the stage earlier,

1149
01:07:34,139 --> 01:07:36,079
and Maddie tells her that it's just the beginning.

1150
01:07:36,519 --> 01:07:40,119
After the play, Jules heads over to Rue and tells her that she loves and misses her.

1151
01:07:40,420 --> 01:07:44,059
Rue doesn't say a word, though, and just kisses Jules before leaving the theater.

1152
01:07:44,500 --> 01:07:48,280
Rue goes on to reveal that she stayed clean until the end of the current school year,

1153
01:07:48,340 --> 01:07:50,820
and that she set her sights on being a good person.

1154
01:07:51,260 --> 01:07:57,420
And that's where the complicated world of Euphoria stops for now, but there's another season out,

1155
01:07:57,579 --> 01:08:00,659
and so you'll have more drama on your plate very soon.

1156
01:08:00,980 --> 01:08:04,579
Don't forget to like, subscribe, comment, do all those other awesome things you people do,

1157
01:08:04,619 --> 01:08:07,099
and I will see you next time.

